OL,3,AHuang agrees to appear before Congress,
OL,4,AUS lawmakers say, after scandal-hit
OL,5,ANvidia CEO resigns
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has resigned as CEO of
OL,8,Ftech giant Nvidia, the company's board
OL,9,Fsays, with chief financial officer
OL,10,FColette Kress appointed interim boss
OL,12,FUS lawmakers on Capitol Hill say Huang
OL,13,Fhas agreed to appear before Congress
OL,14,Ffor questioning, according to the BBC's
OL,15,FUS media partner CBS News
OL,17,FThe company's shares have recovered
OL,18,Fsome ground after plummeting more than
OL,19,F13% when US markets opened shortly
OL,20,Fafter news of Huang's resignation
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
